WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.592
A football is like a sphere. A can is like a cylinder.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:09.463
A cube has equal square faces. A long box resembles a rectangular prism.

00:00:10.283 --> 00:00:14.827
A cone has a pointed tip. A triangular prism has triangular ends.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.047
Look for these solid shapes at home and school.
